# Objects and listening from the softcode audit (#2268): @listen and PUPPET announce that an object
# can hear, a room with no description shows none, examine writes an attribute's owner before its
# flags, an unknown flag is named in the refusal, and @open refuses an exit name with junk after a
# semicolon.
::case obj.login
::login wiz Wiz wizpass
think ok

::case obj.listen  @listen and PUPPET announce that the object can hear
@create ListenProbe
@listen ListenProbe=*
@listen ListenProbe
@set ListenProbe=puppet
@set ListenProbe=!puppet
@recycle ListenProbe

::case obj.room-desc  a room with no description shows nothing under its name
@dig/teleport NoDescRoom
look
@tel/silent me=#0

::case obj.examine  examine writes the owner before the attribute flags
@create ChargeThing
@charges ChargeThing=5
examine ChargeThing/CHARGES
@recycle ChargeThing

::case obj.flag  an unknown flag is named in the refusal
@set me=OOC
@set me=!NOSUCHFLAG

::case obj.open  @open refuses a name with text after a semicolon and a space
@dig/teleport OpenRoom
@open SemiOne ; @open SemiTwo
think [lexits(here)]
@tel/silent me=#0
